# Merged AKO all-DSL runs (triton + cuda_noptx + cuda_unlimited + tilelang).
# Build/cache artifacts and per-iteration bench logs are not tracked going
# forward; tracked loop outputs are solution/, scripts/, ITERATIONS.md, HINTS.md.
# (Historical trajectory/ snapshots committed before the merge stay tracked;
# this rule only stops NEW trajectory logs from being added.)
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.torch_ext/
**/_bench_output.txt
**/trajectory/
# Ad-hoc per-cell diagnostic/scratch scripts left by the optimization agents.
# The findings they produced are captured in each cell's ITERATIONS.md; the
# scripts themselves are not part of the tracked loop outputs.
**/scratchpad/
**/scratch_*.py
**/scripts/sweep.py
